      "body": "HI @joy13 thanks for reporting! \n\nDuckDB uploading partial data sounds wrong to me, since duckdb uses multi part upload which should mean that the files are either written completely or not at all.\n\nWhat I think is happening here is that DuckDB is not setting the null constraints in the parquet files on copy, something that is a known limitation (See https://github.com/duckdb/duckdb/issues/9476#issue-1962404618).\n\nMy suspicion is that you are somehow writing null values into the parquet files which then trigger the null constraint in your table.\n\nSo to investigate this further we'd need to have a proper bug reproduction which can demonstrates that this is actually a problem duckdb side\n\n",
